The fixtures are generated transaction data, not compiled guest firmware. No
third-party driver code is linked into the emulator. Source URLs and SHA-256
values are recorded in sources.json. The generator compiles selected unchanged
driver routines with host stubs and emits writes/read expectations; it does not
build or boot ESP-IDF or establish successful esp_camera_init/frame capture.
